---
// Redirect /tools/pomodoro-timer to /tools/pomodoro-study-timer
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/tools/pomodoro-study-timer" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://campuskit.io/tools/pomodoro-study-timer" />
    <title>Redirecting to Pomodoro Study Timer | CampusKit</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen font-sans text-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm max-w-sm">
      <h1 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Redirecting...</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">Moving to the Pomodoro Study Timer.</p>
      <a href="/tools/pomodoro-study-timer" class="text-sm font-semibold text-academic-700 hover:underline">
        Click here if you are not redirected automatically
      </a>
    </div>
    <script>
      window.location.replace('/tools/pomodoro-study-timer');
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
